1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,200
[CRICKETS CHIRPING]

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,033
Ugh! It's so hot!

3
00:00:10,133 --> 00:00:17,100
[MISCHIEVOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

4
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:37,567
[MISCHIEVOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

5
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,700
- [COMICAL STING]
- [BOTH GASP]

6
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:41,200
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

7
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:43,267
Sorry!
You're making me thirsty--

8
00:00:43,267 --> 00:00:45,800
I-I mean, I'm thirsty!

9
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,100
You're so hot--

10
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,567
I mean,
you're so hot to watch--

11
00:00:48,567 --> 00:00:49,633
Whoo! It's so hot!

12
00:00:49,633 --> 00:00:51,500
- It's really hot, isn't it?!
- S-Sorry, sorry.

13
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,567
That just caught me off guard.

14
00:00:52,567 --> 00:00:53,867
- [JUNE] Yes.
- Yeah, it is hot.

15
00:00:53,867 --> 00:00:55,200
- [JUNE] It's hot, isn't it?
- I'm going to grab some water.

16
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:58,433
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

17
00:00:58,433 --> 00:01:00,200
I-It's hot, isn't it?

18
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:03,233
Is the A/C broken in your room?

19
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,400
[HUFFS] N-No.

20
00:01:06,133 --> 00:01:07,433
I just don't turn it on.

21
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:10,100
Well, it's there
for you to use it.

22
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:13,367
Just because I have one
doesn't mean I have to use it.

23
00:01:14,067 --> 00:01:14,800
Right?

24
00:01:15,233 --> 00:01:16,433
Okay, suit yourself.

25
00:01:16,433 --> 00:01:17,833
It's especially hot these days.
You'll get dehydrated.

26
00:01:17,833 --> 00:01:21,700
[PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

27
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:23,433
[MUSIC STOPS]

28
00:01:26,533 --> 00:01:27,533
[WATER POURING]

29
00:01:27,533 --> 00:01:28,600
Yeah, you're right.

30
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:30,567
[WATER POURING]

31
00:01:30,567 --> 00:01:31,567
It's really hot.

32
00:01:31,567 --> 00:01:35,067
[MISCHIEVOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

33
00:01:35,067 --> 00:01:36,300
Are you hungry?

34
00:01:37,067 --> 00:01:39,600
- There's food over there.
- [CHUCKLING]

35
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:41,700
No!

36
00:01:42,267 --> 00:01:43,500
I'm good.

37
00:01:45,233 --> 00:01:46,200
Hmm!

38
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:48,133
I'm heading back to my room.
Good night.

39
00:01:48,133 --> 00:01:49,167
Good night.

40
00:01:49,167 --> 00:01:51,867
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

41
00:01:51,867 --> 00:01:53,167
[COMICAL STING]

42
00:01:53,167 --> 00:01:54,567
[JUNE] O-M-G!

43
00:01:55,567 --> 00:01:56,567
[SLURPS]

44
00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:58,400
[LOUD GULPING]
